## Task ID Format

`TASK-NNN` where NNN is a zero-padded integer (e.g. TASK-001, TASK-012, TASK-100).

Increment from the highest existing ID — never reuse IDs.

## Task Line Format

```
- [ ] `TASK-NNN` [Role]: [Short description] — `path/to/file.py:line-range`
```

Required fields:
- **Task ID** — unique, sequential (TASK-001, TASK-002, ...)
- **Role** — which agent is assigned (Orchestrator, Engineer, Senior, Lead, Principal, Security, QE, ME)
- **Description** — one line, action-oriented ("Add retry logic to S3 client")
- **File ref** — `path/to/file:line-range` or `context: [description]`

## Status Transitions

```
Pending → In Progress → Done
                      ↘ Blocked (with reason)
```

Rules:
- Move task to **In Progress** before starting work
- Move to **Done** only after CI passes and HANDBACK is written
- Move to **Blocked** with an explicit reason — never leave silently blocked

## DELEGATE / TODO Mapping

Each `TASK-NNN` in TODO.md corresponds to a DELEGATE file:

```
~/.copilot/queue/incoming/TASK-NNN.yaml  ← in-flight
~/.copilot/queue/done/TASK-NNN-handback.yaml  ← completed
```

When a HANDBACK is received, update TODO.md immediately.
